Alembic migrations for the shared AutoChannel schema.

    export SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI=postgresql://...
    alembic -c packages/autochannel-db/alembic.ini upgrade head
    alembic -c packages/autochannel-db/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

These were previously managed by Flask-Migrate in autochannel-ui; revision ids are
unchanged, so existing databases continue from their current alembic_version.
